[center][size=5][b]Faster Space Station Takeoff[/b][/size]
Speeds up the slow flight out of the landing bay in stations and the anomaly.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
Taking off from a station hands your ship to a slow scripted departure. This raises the speed of that flight, shortens the climb and the turn to face out, and brings the speed you get control back at up with it, so you are clear of the bay in a fraction of the time.

[b]Options[/b]
[list]
[*][b]10x[/b] - ten times faster[/*]
[*][b]5x[/b] - five times faster[/*]
[*][b]2x[/b] - twice as fast[/*]
[/list]
[b]Demo video[/b]
The video shows the departure compressed all the way, with the time from the pad to the handover on screen. The rotation of the ship as it comes off the pad is a slow part of the same sequence and this mod does not touch it, so [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4569]Faster Spaceship Docking Rotation Reloaded [/url]goes with it.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies the six dock entity files of the space stations and the anomaly.
It may conflict with any other mod editing those files[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS [/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].